  "description": "IN STOCK AT A DEALER NEAR YOU!\nVamoose continues to innovate by anticipating what our customers might need or want for standard equipment on their cycles. But there is a reason we call this Mammoth \"Super\" and we have made improvements for 2023 models!\nSUPER MAMMOTH X 750 AWD ST - DUAL MOTOR MONSTER!\nThis Vamoose Super Mammoth AWD e-bike comes with two 52V 750W motors (front and rear) providing exceptional power and torque for climbing hills or crushing fresh powder! By adding a torque sensor to the 2022 models, the Super Mammoth improves both precision and control. An impressive machine, the Super Mammoth comes standard with a truly gigantic 52V 20Ah battery producing an incredible 1040 Watt-hours of performance - a range of +84km! Even better, you can add an additional 52V 15Ah battery to take you even further (1850 watt hours and 150 km)!\nThis cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• Dual 52V 750W motors (ability to downsample to 500W)\n\n• 52V 20 Ah Samsung Battery with additional battery optional\n\n• A 6061 aircraft aluminum frame with alloy front forks\n\n• 26\" x 4.8” Fat Tires\n\n• Front and rear fenders\n\nKingmeter K5266 w Bluetooth, downsampling, USB\n\n21700 50 E CELLS 52V 20 Ah Samsung\n\nRST AIR with travel stop\n\nTektro HD-E730 Dorado 4 PISTON Hydraulic 203 mm ROTOR front and 180 mm rear, 2.3 mm thick\n\n26\" x 4.8\" MAXXIS MINION FBR FBF\n\nRear, with front mount option\n\n4-6 hrs.\n\n166 x 34 x 86.5\n\n66 X 13 X 34\n\n41 kg NW / 51 kg GW\n\n90 lbs NW / 112 lbs GW\n\n330 lbs.",
